flowchart TD
  start([Start]) --> input[/Input Request/]
  input --> validate[Validate Request]
  validate --> valid{Valid?}
  valid -->|No| log>Log Issue]
  valid -->|Yes| review[/Review Manually\]
  log --> e1([End])
  review --> approve{Approve?}
  approve -->|No| changes[Request Changes]
  approve -->|Yes| save[(Save to Database)]
  changes --> review
  save --> gen>Generate Document]
  gen --> prep{{Prepare Output}}
  prep --> done([Done])
